=== Target 1: App Metadata System ===
1. AppMetadata struct fields:
type AppMetadata struct {
	// ID is the unique application identifier, typically a reverse-DNS style string
	ID string
	// Name is the human-friendly application name
	Name string
	// Version is the application version string
	Version string
	// Build is the application build number
	Build int
	// Icon is the application icon resource
	Icon Resource

2. App.Metadata() in interface:
	Metadata() AppMetadata

3. app/meta.go exists with SetMetadata:
-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 396 Oct  4 23:53 /app/app/meta.go
func SetMetadata(m fyne.AppMetadata) {

